  "solution": "Logic: (1st number - 4) × 1st number = 2nd number\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 6 : 12\n\n**(6 - 4)**__ × 6 = 12\n\n__**2 × 6**__ = 12\n\n12 = 12 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 10 : 60\n\n**(10 - 4)**__ × 10 = 60\n\n__**6 **____**× 10**__ = 60\n\n60 = 60 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 8 : 40\n\n**(8 - 4)**__ × 8 = 40\n\n__**4 **____**× 8**__ = 40\n\n**32 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 7 : 21\n\n**(7 - 4)**__ × 7 = 21\n\n__**3 **____**× 7**__ = 21\n\n21 = 21 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
